###
# VS Code REST Client Debug File
# Install "REST Client" extension to use this file
# Click "Send Request" above each request to execute
###

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@projectId = cmez8jxr500075kl57r8to8ga

### Login Request
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUsername": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Pass@123"
}

### Extract token from login response
@token = {{login.response.body.tokens.accessToken}}

### Project Sync Request (use after login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### Alternative: Manual token (if you have token.json)
# Replace with actual token from token.json file
@manualToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9

### Project Sync with Manual Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{manualToken}}

{}